  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(1)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8242;&#8242;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br />Or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8242;&#8242;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(2)</mo></math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0099_f99769d4d0b4.jpg\" style=\"width: 294px; height: 181px;\" /><br />Again, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8242;&#8242;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(3)</mo></math><br /><br />From equations (2) and (3),<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(4)</mo></math></p><p>Adding equations&nbsp;(1) and (4), <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>650</mn><mi>a</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>650</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></mfrac></math><br />This acceleration is downwards.</p>"
  }
